    "caption": "Batana oil is trending\u2026 but here\u2019s the truth: There\u2019s no scientific evidence that batana oil treats hair loss or helps regrow hair. It hasn\u2019t been studied in clinical trials, observational studies, or even lab models for alopecia. Yes, it\u2019s been used traditionally in Central America and can be a great oil to seal moisture into your ends. BUT IT IS NOT a proven treatment for hair loss. And anyone telling you it is\u2026 is trying to scam you. If your goal is actual regrowth, first you need an actual diagnosis!! Then you need evidence-based treatments. See a dermatologist that specifically specializes in hair. Save this so you don\u2019t fall for the hype.",
